ntain highlights matching the hair's highlight color. 【About the Mascot】 ・The creature on the shoulder is called \"Tanuki Pants.\" Its depiction is optional.\n\n■ Nekotanuki's Personality (For reference) ・Full of energy ・Expressive ・Hates losing ・A glutton ■ Potential Uses ・Use on social media (X, YouTube, etc.) for VTuber activities ・Membership perks (distribution to fan site supporters, rewards, wallpapers, etc.) ・Net print (may overlay text/elements) ・Combining with text or free assets, minor editing that doesn't compromise the image (color correction, cropping, etc.) ・Merchandise sales ※If the above uses are difficult, we sincerely apologize but would appreciate it if you could cancel the order. ■ Desired Delivery Format Layered PSD data (or data containing transparent PNGs) with character, background, signature, etc.\n\nhttps://www.google.com/search?sca_esv=c9a82c01d27467b1&udm=2&biw=1745&bih=870&aic=0&sxsrf=ANbL-n6Wfd4bySQmyKLVIbRO_t5kvLggMQ: 1769133936688&q=Brackets+%E3%83%9D%E3%83%9D%E3%83%83%E3%82%AF E3%82%A6%E3%82%A3%E3%83%89%E3%82%A6+%E3%83%9D%E3%83%BC%E3%82%BA&stick=H4sIAAA", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hachibun/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1295120, "client_id": 3753843, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/150925d9/uploads/origins/dcc70e78-6144-41e7-b5d5-8c8de80833d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c63bfed5fb7dc1f7fd4175370637e055", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/150925d9/uploads/origins/dcc70e78-6144-41e7-b5d5-8c8de80833d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c63bfed5fb7dc1f7fd4175370637e055, https://si.imgix.net/150925d9/uploads/origins/dcc70e78-6144-41e7-b5d5-8c8de80833d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6679090a97ad1d1c95f58ec8d255d7c4 2x,