se of death, so please include them! I have included a sketch in my drive link with the location of the markings on her body!\n\nI would love to use the artwork for sns such as twitter, twitch, youtube, etc as well as vtubing activities. I would like to use it for stickers or merch! If possible, please include a psd with the layers separated~!\n\nThank you~!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1uTXmG90gMMi2bi0aEE-rs4S1DTWdkL-r?usp=drive_link\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1uTXmG90gMMi2bi0aEE-rs4S1DTWdkL-r?usp=drive_link", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hachibun/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4e280645/uploads/origins/537c682d-ef3d-413c-96d4-47a710f43e83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9ae5518795ce767d88c640dd2d87a254", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4e280645/uploads/origins/537c682d-ef3d-413c-96d4-47a710f43e83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9ae5518795ce767d88c640dd2d87a254, https://si.imgix.net/4e280645/uploads/origins/537c682d-ef3d-413c-96d4-47a710f43e83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=786d3992b5e183dfe8949cb61f66138b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4e280645/uploads/origins/537c682d-ef3d-413c-96d4-47a710f43e83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=055a9fa37c330431f162a13d77856df3 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1295120, "nc": 16}, {"path": "/@hachibun/works/3", "private_thumb